      "content": "<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 2026-07-23</p><p></p><p><strong>Overall: 99% complete (179/180 tasks) — BETA LIVE</strong></p><pre><code>█████████████████████████████░</code></pre><p></p><p><strong>Bootstrap roadmap — you are here:</strong></p><pre><code>Phase 1  Establish Web Presence    ✅ done\nPhase 2  App Store Preparation     ✅ done  (TestFlight Build 3 live)\nPhase 3  Validate Before Scaling   ◀ YOU ARE HERE  (beta feedback)\nPhase 4  Launch &amp; Early Revenue    ○ next   (public launch + paid SKU)\nPhase 5  Scale When Revenue Allows ○ later</code></pre><p></p><p><strong>By category:</strong></p><p>Documents &amp; drafts:     100% <code>████████████████████████</code> 15/15</p><p>Code changes:            100% <code>████████████████████████</code> 53/53</p><p>Decision docs:          100% <code>████████████████████████</code> 5/5</p><p>Bug fixes:             100% <code>████████████████████████</code> 3/3</p><p>Awaiting your decisions: 0% <code>░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</code> 0/5</p><p>External / user-only:    50% <code>████████████░░░░░░░░░░░░</code> 6/12</p><p>Post-launch (deferred):   0% <code>░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░</code> 0/10</p><p></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p></p><p></p><p><strong><em><u>IdeaM - Feature Names</u></em></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;